  "_comment_maps": "A map name may end in @N: its source is downscaled to N pixels before import (repo size; the sim's texture quality never shows more).",
  "_comment_lamp": "LampRed is the start-light lens: off by default; the world actor lights it at runtime (AFSDSWorldActor::SetStartLights).",
  "_comment_paint": "Painted steel (SteelWhite, SteelGrey, DoorPanel) uses the smooth plastic scan: paint is a dielectric, and the chipped-paint scan read as marble on large panels.",
