  "_comment_foliage": "Leaf cards (trees): colour and opacity drawn by tools/assetgen/blender (foliage_textures). tint is the average albedo; each tree picks a colour between tint and tint_vary. translucency scales the light let through the leaves.",
  "_comment_grass": "Grass: late-August Catalonia, dried to straw (recolor 0.8). Tint set so the verges come out 1.5 to 1.9 times as bright as the track's asphalt, as on the orthophoto. roughness 1.5 keeps the scan from glinting in the sun.",
  "paint": {
    "_comment": "Road paint (M_WorldPaint): the asphalt scan under a paint layer that covers `coverage` of it; the stones' tops and worn patches show through. set, tile_m and tint are the asphalt's, so the grain lines up with the road around the paint.",
