  "_comment_wear": "wear 1 (AsphaltTrack): the colour is multiplied by twice the mesh's vertex red, where the world actor writes the wear map (docs/worlds.md); 0 everywhere else.",
  "_comment_photo": "Checked against the ICGC orthophoto (docs/worlds.md), as linear-light ratios to the track's asphalt in a top-down showcase render: Asphalt (plain, no racing rubber: pit lane and exit) 1.15x the track; Grass 1.5-1.9x; PaintRed and PaintGreen as photographed; PanelDark (pit roof) 0.5x; SolarPanel 0.9x (cells and frames averaged at 25 cm). The photo's whites clip, so the white roofs and lines are not tuned to it."
